  "intent": "按固定速率生成令牌并放入桶中，请求取到令牌才被放行，从而限制平均速率并允许突发。",
  "applicability": {
    "constraints": {
      "rate": "tokens_per_second",
      "capacity": "burst_allowance",
      "time_source": "monotonic_clock",
      "decision": "consume_token_or_reject",
      "distributed": "shared_or_per_node"
    },
    "counterexamples": [
      "需要严格平滑输出、不允许任何突发时——应使用漏桶（leaky bucket）",
      "只想限制并发数时——信号量或隔离舱更直接"
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "pattern.resilience.rate_limiter",
      "algorithm.concurrency.bounded_queue"
    ]
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(1) 每次判定",
    "extra_space": "O(1)"
  },
